# ==============================================================================
# Rule Name: AI-Overseas (Custom)
# Target Policy: AI (Local select group, default VMISS 9929, manually switchable)
# Description: Overseas AI services (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, Grok, Muse from Meta, etc.)
# Collision Protection:
#   - Gemini: Uses exact DOMAIN rules for APIs. DOES NOT include googleapis.com or google.com
#   - Grok: Uses grok.com and x.ai. DOES NOT include x.com or twitter.com
#   - Muse from Meta: Uses muse.ai and meta.ai. DOES NOT include facebook/instagram/meta.com
# ==============================================================================

# --- OpenAI / ChatGPT ---
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,chatgpt.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,openai.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaistatic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaiusercontent.com
DOMAIN,chat.openai.com
DOMAIN,chat.openai.com.cdn.cloudflare.net
DOMAIN,openai-api.arkoselabs.com
DOMAIN,openaicom-api-bdcpf8c6d2e9atf6.z01.azurefd.net
DOMAIN,openaicomproductionae4b.blob.core.windows.net
DOMAIN,production-openaicom-storage.azureedge.net

# --- Anthropic / Claude ---
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,anthropic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claudeusercontent.com

# --- Google Gemini / AI Studio (Precision Anti-Collision) ---
DOMAIN,gemini.google.com
DOMAIN,bard.google.com
DOMAIN,aistudio.google.com
DOMAIN,makersuite.google.com
DOMAIN,generativelanguage.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,alkalimakersuite-pa.clients6.google.com
DOMAIN,proactivebackend-pa.googleapis.com

# --- xAI / Grok (Precision Anti-Collision with Twitter) ---
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,grok.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,x.ai
DOMAIN,api.x.ai

# --- Muse from Meta (Precision Anti-Collision with Meta Platforms) ---
# App Store ID: 6760173601, Official: https://muse.ai/
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,muse.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,meta.ai
DOMAIN,api.meta.ai

# --- Perplexity & Other Confirmed AI Services ---
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,perplexity.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,poe.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,sora.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cohere.com
